{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14832","headline":"詶李叔度秋夜喜相遇因伤关东僚友丧逝见赠 · 卢纶","name":"詶李叔度秋夜喜相遇因伤关东僚友丧逝见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒月照秋城，秋风泉涧鸣。\n过时见兰蕙，独夜感衰荣。\n酒散同移疾，心悲似远行。\n以愚求作友，何德敢称兄。\n谷变波长急，松枯药未成。\n恐看新鬓色，怯问故人名。\n野泽云阴散，荒原日气生。\n羁飞本难定，非是恶弦惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}